      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## PowerScale - System Workload (PP Dataset 0)\n\nOneFS system process resource consumption from Partitioned Performance\nDataset 0. This dataset is predefined and always available on OneFS 9.x+ clusters \u2014 no PP dataset configuration needed.\n\nShows which daemons and system processes consume CPU, perform I/O, and generate latency. Useful for identifying runaway system processes.",
